Error [E0220]: `values` cannot be read while `selected` has a live exclusive write window into it
  --> runtime_disjoint_views_reject_alias_storage_and_owner_invalidation_2.jet:5:6
    |
  5 |     &values.push(3)
    |      ^^^^^^
 Why: `selected` is an exclusive window into `values[fresh]`; reading the owner beside that window would be rejected after lowering
 Fix: Read or edit through `selected` instead of `values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0220

Error [E0212]: `values` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `selected` is still looking into it
  --> runtime_disjoint_views_reject_alias_storage_and_owner_invalidation_2.jet:5:6
    |
  5 |     &values.push(3)
    |      ^^^^^^
 Why: `selected` is a live exclusive mutable view into `values[fresh]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `selected` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
